        {
          "text": "Kuzwa kunkanda akuzwa kucilundu eci ca-Lebano mane kusikila kumulonga, mulonga mupati wa-Firate, nyika yoonse yaba-Hiti, akusikila kulwizi lupati luli kububbila, yoonse buyo iyooba CISI canu. ",
